EnableProsodyAssessment |
Enables prosody assessment for your pronunciation evaluation. This feature assesses aspects like stress, intonation, speaking speed, and rhythm. This feature provides insights into the naturalness and expressiveness of your speech. Enabling prosody assessment is optional. If this method is called, the ProsodyScore result value is returned. |
Get pronunciation assessment results
When speech is recognized, you can request the pronunciation assessment results as SDK objects or a JSON string.
using (var speechRecognizer = new SpeechRecognizer(
speechConfig,
audioConfig))
{
// (Optional) get the session ID
speechRecognizer.SessionStarted += (s, e) => {
Console.WriteLine($"SESSION ID: {e.SessionId}");
};
pronunciationAssessmentConfig.ApplyTo(speechRecognizer);
var speechRecognitionResult = await speechRecognizer.RecognizeOnceAsync();
// The pronunciation assessment result as a Speech SDK object
